WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,180
I passed

2
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:12,380
You're a lucky rat, guest.

3
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,100
I'm the room attendant today

4
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:18,180
Do you need any help? Of course I can.

5
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:19,550
Come here

6
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,900
Help me get the green bottle next to the bed.

7
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:25,260
That's the biggest guest

8
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:28,220
I don't recommend that bottle because I'm afraid it will explode.

9
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,310
If I tell you to take it, you can take it

10
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:31,710
There's so much nonsense

11
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:34,430
This is what your hotel calls waiters.

12
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:36,990
Believe it or not, I will complain to you.

13
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,240
This can be considered a mission failure, right?

14
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:42,250
According to the rules of the game, I will be

15
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:44,790
Why don't you hurry up?
